# A sole actual of unknown description (an application of a receiver) is evaluated once before the decision and
# its value is weighed by W and E (fable Р130, fable 2026-11-21): f(merge(A; B)) at `@: s Model` runs, seen 2.
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
@: shared data[0]
@: Model ()
fn: f (@: s Model) int
    return: length(s)
sub: main () (
    A(int: a 1)
    B(int: b 2)
)
    shared\Observed\seen := f(merge(A; B))
main()
